{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-7-16","kind":"proposition","title":"等量关系：整数","englishTitle":"If two numbers by multiplying one another make certain numbers, the numbers so produced will be equal to one another.","book":7,"number":16,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.16","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.16/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":16,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-7-16@raw-1306566fae70de07","contentId":"euclid-7-16","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1306566fae70de07fbde28a6235fc942de5a373c7ef048a51f443b1a635ffe72","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-7-16.statement","euclid-7-16.construction.1","euclid-7-16.proof.1","euclid-7-16.proof.2","euclid-7-16.proof.3","euclid-7-16.proof.4","euclid-7-16.proof.5","euclid-7-16.proof.6","euclid-7-16.conclusion","euclid-7-16.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-7-16.statement","contentId":"euclid-7-16","revisionId":"euclid-7-16@raw-1306566fae70de07","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7a0dd16a68184e680e64e55c56e6d9300131de40aa7a1c14ae66d34e6c2a85b8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If two numbers by multiplying one another make certain numbers, the numbers so produced will be equal to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果两个数字通过相互乘法得出一定的数字,那么如此延长的数字将等于另一个数字。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-16.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-7-16","revisionId":"euclid-7-16@raw-1306566fae70de07","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"103146a2dc97e0097a96bee609a1587fbb6fc6479c3d04901378b953f061bcf3","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let A, B be two numbers, and let A by multiplying B make C, and B by multiplying A make D; I say that C is equal to D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让A,B成为两个数字,A和B的产物C,B乘以A,D;我说C等于D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-16.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-7-16","revisionId":"euclid-7-16@raw-1306566fae70de07","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"957ad9974116068cba47d3a2c3c6343328771013885f093eb17f5507029809fd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since A by multiplying B has made C, therefore B measures C according to the units in A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为,自A乘以B后,C,因此,根据A的单位,B 整除 C。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-16.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-7-16","revisionId":"euclid-7-16@raw-1306566fae70de07","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"84bf99b3af47d9c103899c910bf3a5e59dcd2fb35abec696885e504bbdf4870a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the unit E also measures the number A according to the units in it; therefore the unit E measures A the same number of times that B measures C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但根据单位,单位,E 和A,单位,单位,E,A 与B,整除,C的乘以相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-16.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-7-16","revisionId":"euclid-7-16@raw-1306566fae70de07","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0309ae415a4a0bb10c7da0b48feb482a055d450917d452ef4492bade1af80612","citations":["euclid-7-15"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, alternately, the unit E measures the number B the same number of times that A measures C. [[VII. 15](/principles/euclid-7-15)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,换句话说,单位 E 整除,B,是A 整除 C的两倍。 [[VII. 15](/principles/euclid-7-15)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-16.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-7-16","revisionId":"euclid-7-16@raw-1306566fae70de07","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5be32f5708725f1da74292ef6ea123c694faebed7d57fef88c9bd790451b8ea1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, since B by multiplying A has made D, therefore A measures D according to the units in B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"B乘以A, 使D, 因此,根据B的单位, B的A, 整除, D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-16.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-7-16","revisionId":"euclid-7-16@raw-1306566fae70de07","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5ec6a5e9f87fbf801ba79e713bbdc803a8fac89409a99457274e236fd0d18812","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the unit E also measures B according to the units in it; therefore the unit E measures the number B the same number of times that A measures D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但根据单位,单位,E,整除,B,单位,E,B,B,B乘以A,整除,D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-16.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-7-16","revisionId":"euclid-7-16@raw-1306566fae70de07","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"4cfec752f103e3fd79e00bacb295f659ec8100b6c85a193d228bf373c94f9468","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the unit E measured the number B the same number of times that A measures C; therefore A measures each of the numbers C, D the same number of times."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,单位 E整除的数字是B,是A 整除 C的两倍;因此,C数字中,每个数字是A 整除, D数字是同样次数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-16.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-7-16","revisionId":"euclid-7-16@raw-1306566fae70de07","order":8,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"42f27aee06b0a0d2baa3493f5cb79e70b2c86fe69dc0d5ce537bd26bb3f0d399","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore C is equal to D. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,C等于D,Q,D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-7-16.source","contentId":"euclid-7-16","revisionId":"euclid-7-16@raw-1306566fae70de07","order":9,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f63635ee1007bc1b754b423e44991b7132fb6ae569f07d141c43e902dad1c33a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.16/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:7.prop.16\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-7-16:euclid-7-15:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-7-16","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-7-16.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-7-15","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseu